{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261127/photo/bkn-20261127200013622-1127_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261127200455\"/><p>康景花園一名女住戶墮樓死亡。</p><p>今午(27日)4時25分，一名姓李(61歲)婦人懷疑從屯門青善街58號康景花園的住所墮下，倒臥於大廈對開，由保安員發現及報案。救援人員抵達現場，證實事主已經死亡，其死因有待驗屍後確定。警員在現場沒有檢獲遺書，並將案件暫列「屍體發現」跟進，正調查事主的墮樓原因。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T12:43:56.988248+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":153,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T12:00:13+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T14:28:09.612323+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T12:37:20.222516+00:00","content_hash":"a98da3937868dfea33012ed9081085f728d17c6b72836a5fc94987ca55686bcb","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-27T12:43:56.988248+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}